7.2 Production Deployment (Linux / Docker / Gunicorn)

For production deployment on Linux / AWS / DigitalOcean:

Database Switch (PostgreSQL): In .env:

ini
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://dbuser:securepass@localhost:5432/finance_db

(SQLAlchemy automatically creates all tables on initial startup).

Run with Production WSGI Server (Gunicorn):

bash
pip install gunicorn psycopg2-binary
gunicorn -w 4 -b 0.0.0.0:5000 "backend.app:create_app()"

Reverse Proxy Configuration (Nginx):

nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name finance.yourdomain.com;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:5000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    }
}
